 "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:18:38Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Yes!", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:18:55Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "What's the surface area rule?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:18:59Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "That’s what I meant I guess, should have framed better", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:19:08Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "US regulates that at least 1/3rd of the surface area of the indicator should illuminate at the first instance", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:19:17Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Oh okay", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:19:29Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Oh ok", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:19:39Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Which gif", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:19:51Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The link?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:03Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "So Audi had to “break” their signal into 2, where the a which area illuminates first and then the rest of the indicator illuminates sequentially", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:04Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Nice", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:12Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Yes", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:22Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Nice funda", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:39Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Mast lurn", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:47Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "A lot of other manufacturers also faced this, right? I remember reading s case study involving mustang and Merc", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:57Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Good lurn", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:20:59Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Or was it just Audi?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:21:03Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "It is one of those things which you can’t unsee.\nThe Mustang can do sequential illumination because its tail light is a 3-piece one.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:22:27Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Might be a silly question but when you turn on the light doesnt the whole thing just illuminate at once? Gen there are just one or two bulbs inside ‎", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:22:34Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "And the first piece would already be covering the required surface area. Makes sense.", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-15T02:22:55Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "There was another feature launched by Merc in the S class. Where it could “see” the bumps in the road and adjust its suspension accordingly\nBut that feature was not available in India because the frequency needed for the feature was controlled by the government due to some old rule", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]